<section class="border-b border-border bg-card"><div class="container-page py-14 sm:py-20"><div class="mb-8"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-muted-foreground"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a aria-current="page" class="hover:text-accent active" data-status="active" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/' ) ); ?>">Services</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-current="page" class="text-foreground">AI Behavior Analysis</span></li></ol></nav></div><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>AI Behavior Analysis</p><h1 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl leading-[1.08] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Behaviour is data, once you know how to read it</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Understand anxiety, aggression and stress through measured behaviour.</p><div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-foreground transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/contact/' ) ); ?>">Book a consultation</a><a class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent" href="#faq">Read the FAQ</a></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Introduction</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Understanding ai behavior analysis</h2></div><div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><p>Behavioural problems are the leading non-medical reason animals are surrendered to shelters. They are also the area where owners get the least reliable information, because behaviour happens when nobody is watching.</p><p>PawlogicTech records what actually occurs: vocalisation patterns, pacing, destructive episodes, posture, and the environmental conditions surrounding each event.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-background p-8 sm:p-10"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground">The problem</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl leading-snug sm:text-3xl">You cannot fix what you never observe</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Separation anxiety peaks in the first thirty minutes after you leave. Reactivity spikes on specific routes at specific times. Owners are structurally unable to witness the behaviour they most need to understand.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Advice is usually based on an owner's recollection rather than observation.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Trigger identification by trial and error takes months and often fails.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Progress is judged by feel, so effective interventions get abandoned early.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Medical pain is frequently misread as a behavioural problem.</li></ul></div><div class="rounded-3xl bg-primary p-8 text-primary-foreground sm:p-10"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Our solution</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl leading-snug sm:text-3xl">Continuous behavioural evidence with trigger correlation</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">We log behavioural events with timestamps and context, then correlate them against departures, arrivals, weather, noise, visitors and routine changes to isolate what actually drives the behaviour.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Audio-event classification that recognises distress vocalisation without recording conversations.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Trigger correlation across environmental and schedule variables.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Objective progress scoring across a training programme.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Pain-versus-behaviour screening that flags likely medical causes.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Benefits</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">What you get out of it</h2></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Real triggers, found fast</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Weeks of guesswork replaced by a ranked list of correlated triggers.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Measurable progress</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">See whether an intervention is working within days, not months.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Fewer surrenders</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Behaviour that is understood is behaviour that can be managed.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Better professional referrals</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Behaviourists start with evidence instead of an intake questionnaire.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-secondary"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Features</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Everything included as standard</h2></div><dl class="grid gap-x-10 gap-y-8 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Distress vocalisation detection</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">On-device classification of barking, howling and yowling by emotional signature.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Departure protocols</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">Structured separation-anxiety programmes with automatically measured outcomes.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Reactivity mapping</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">Where and when reactive episodes occur, mapped against route and time.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Stress load index</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">A daily composite of physiological and behavioural stress markers.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Household context</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">Correlation with visitors, deliveries, storms, fireworks and schedule change.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Privacy-first audio</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">Audio is classified on-device; only event labels leave your home.</dd></div></dl></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>How it works</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Four steps from setup to insight</h2></div><ol class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><li class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-sage">01</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl">Observe</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Two weeks of passive recording establishes the actual behavioural pattern.</p></li><li class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-sage">02</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl">Correlate</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Events are matched against environmental and schedule variables.</p></li><li class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-sage">03</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl">Intervene</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">A structured programme targets the highest-ranked triggers first.</p></li><li class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-sage">04</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl">Measure</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Frequency, duration and intensity are re-scored weekly against the starting point.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Specialisms</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Inside AI Behavior Analysis</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Five focused capabilities. Explore whichever matches the problem you are trying to solve.</p></div><ul class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/anxiety-detection/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">Anxiety Detection</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Measure distress instead of guessing at it</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-accent">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/aggression-prevention/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">Aggression Prevention</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Intercept the warning phase, not the incident</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-accent">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/sleep-pattern-analysis/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">Sleep Pattern Analysis</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The most under-used diagnostic signal in pet care</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-accent">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/social-behavior-insights/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">Social Behavior Insights</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">See the household dynamic your pets never show you</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-accent">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/behavior-reports/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">Behavior Reports</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Documentation professionals can actually work from</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-accent">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div></a></li></ul></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center"><div><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Who needs this</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Households and organisations this is built for</h2></div><dl class="mt-8 space-y-6"><div class="rule-accent"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Separation anxiety</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Dogs that struggle when left alone, especially post-pandemic adopted animals.</dd></div><div class="rule-accent"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Reactive dogs</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Lunging and barking at dogs, people, traffic or wildlife.</dd></div><div class="rule-accent"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Rescue and rehoming</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Animals with unknown history where baseline behaviour must be established.</dd></div><div class="rule-accent"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Multi-pet tension</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Households where inter-animal conflict is escalating.</dd></div></dl></div><img alt="Veterinary professional reviewing ai behavior analysis data for a patient" class="w-full rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-lift" decoding="async" height="900" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() ); ?>/assets/images/vet-review.webp" width="1200"/></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-primary text-primary-foreground"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-3xl"><p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Why PawlogicTech</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Clinically governed, privacy-first, and deliberately quiet</h2><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">Every threshold in AI Behavior Analysis is reviewed by our veterinary advisory panel before release. We tune for clinical usefulness rather than notification volume, we compare your animal only against itself, and we never sell your data. Everything exports, because the record belongs to you and should follow your animal wherever it goes.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24" id="faq"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>FAQ</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">AI Behavior Analysis questions, answered</h2></div><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card"><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Is my home audio being recorded and stored?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">No. Audio is processed on the device itself and discarded immediately. Only classified event labels, such as 'distress vocalisation, 4 minutes', are transmitted. Human speech is never stored or transmitted.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Can this replace a qualified behaviourist?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">For mild cases it is often sufficient on its own. For aggression, severe anxiety or bite history you need a certified behaviourist, and our data makes their work substantially more effective.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">How quickly will I see change?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Trigger identification usually takes two to three weeks. Meaningful behavioural change from a well-targeted programme typically appears between weeks four and twelve.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Does it distinguish pain from misbehaviour?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">It screens for it. Sudden reactivity, night restlessness and posture change are classic pain presentations, and when that pattern appears we recommend veterinary assessment before any training programme.</p></details></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Related services</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Services that pair well with this one</h2></div><ul class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3"><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-health-monitoring/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">AI Pet Health Monitoring</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Continuous vitals, early-warning alerts and vet-ready health records.</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-training/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">AI Pet Training</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Adaptive, reward-based training programmes that measure real progress.</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/smart-pet-care/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">Smart Pet Care</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Connected feeding, hydration, climate and daily-care automation.</p></div></a></li></ul></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Further reading</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Articles from our veterinary and behavioural team</h2></div><ul class="mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3"><li><article><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Pet Health · 8 min read</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl leading-snug"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/blog/early-signs-of-illness-in-dogs/' ) ); ?>">The Early Signs of Illness in Dogs Most Owners Miss</a></h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">By the time a dog looks unwell, the condition has usually been developing for weeks. These are the eight signals that appear first, and why almost nobody notices them.</p></article></li><li><article><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Behaviour · 7 min read</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl leading-snug"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/blog/how-ai-detects-pet-anxiety/' ) ); ?>">How AI Detects Pet Anxiety Before You Do</a></h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The behaviour you most need to understand happens when nobody is home. Measurement solves a problem that observation structurally cannot.</p></article></li><li><article><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Nutrition · 6 min read</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl leading-snug"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/blog/smart-feeding-and-pet-obesity/' ) ); ?>">Smart Feeding and the Pet Obesity Problem</a></h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Nobody intends to overfeed. Portion drift is a measurement failure, not a discipline failure, and measurement is the thing that fixes it.</p></article></li></ul></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-primary px-8 py-16 text-primary-foreground sm:px-14"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-accent/25 blur-3xl"></span><div class="relative max-w-2xl"><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Ready to put AI Behavior Analysis to work?</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">A short consultation tells us your animal, your household and your goal. We will recommend the smallest configuration that solves it.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-foreground transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/contact/' ) ); ?>">Book a consultation</a><a aria-current="page" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-primary-foreground/30 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors hover:border-primary-foreground active" data-status="active" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/' ) ); ?>">Explore services</a></div></div></div></div></section><script>(function(a,f){let l;try{l=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem(a)||"{}")}catch{return}const n=l?.[f||history.state?.__TSR_key];let c=!1;for(const t in n){const e=n[t],o=e?.scrollX,s=e?.scrollY;if(Number.isFinite(o)&&Number.isFinite(s)){if(t==="window")scrollTo(o,s),c=!0;else if(t)try{const r=document.querySelector(t);r&&(r.scrollLeft=o,r.scrollTop=s)}catch{}}}if(c)return;const i=location.hash.slice(1);if(i){const t=history.state?.__hashScrollIntoViewOptions??!0;if(t){const e=document.getElementById(i);e&&e.scrollIntoView(t)}return}scrollTo(0,0)})("tsr-scroll-restoration-v1_3");document.currentScript.remove()</script>
